  "_comment": "Golden query set for retrieval-quality scoring, over examples/fixtures/eval-repo (a synthetic telemetry pipeline: C++ header + source, Python, SQL, XML config). Score it with: contextlake kb eval --golden examples/fixtures/golden-queries.json --retriever fts   (add --retriever semantic|hybrid once embeddings are built). Every entry uses match=\"name\" ON PURPOSE: node ids are a slug plus a digest of the symbol's identity, so an id-scheme change (7.0.0 changed all of them) would silently invalidate an id-matched set while looking like a retrieval regression. Names are what a person searches for and what stays stable.",
